  "evidence": [
    "All86 database migration/regression cases and six new typed PostgreSQL cases pass. Four new migration cases preserve column-only non-login view ownership, RLS, current group membership, original bound rooms and archive recovery.",
    "Two fictional participants affiliated to different companies can retain one group pair without selecting the peer Matrix identity; nullable canonical identity stays explicit and affiliations are deduplicated.",
    "Opposite concurrent inserts have one winner; opposite repository openers using the transaction-owned pair guard observe one immutable intent. Failed results, cancellation/interruption and post-write readback faults roll back.",
    "Unsigned ID and original company/conversation keysets finish with no cursor on the last or empty page. Every returned and overfetched row is validated; duplicate, reversed, oversized, foreign, malformed and non-progressing acquisitions fail as a whole.",
    "Original company conversations and optional bound rooms retain explicit coordinates and source rows. A real bound-room fixture passes original job/device/provisioning publication guards, survives parent purge and pg_dump/pg_restore, and does not grant ordinary root access to company tables."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Current native open/read/list and room adoption/provisioning are next. Directory identity is neither provider-user existence, private-key possession nor a room/recipient capability. No peer identity is selected by impersonation.",
    "Recipient query/claim/to-device, group content/sync/push and Mobile preflight/stage/freeze/completion/adoption remain required. Offline public-key availability must not depend on short native/provider tokens; hard-parent replacement requires explicit recovery.",
    "No DI or endpoint changed in this storage increment. Next DI integration must exercise actual API and FULL worker. No real-user data, phone UI, product APK or live rollout was changed.",
    "All54 communications groups remain open. Main e090e7e3, Mobile4678042f/hosted product0b804cb2, normal phone28/live8b40/schema116 pushON/SMTPOFF and Starter9959c1d are unchanged at this evidence boundary."
  ]
